    "id": "automating-cicd-docker-github-actions",
    "slug": "automating-cicd-docker-github-actions",
    "title": "Automating CI/CD Pipelines with Docker, GitHub Actions, and Linux Servers",
    "excerpt": "Step-by-step blueprint for building zero-downtime continuous integration and continuous deployment pipelines for enterprise web applications.",
