    "slug": "building-accessible-web-interfaces-wcag",
    "title": "Building Accessible Web Interfaces: A Practical WCAG 2.2 Compliance Guide",
    "excerpt": "How to engineer semantic, keyboard-navigable, screen-reader compatible web apps that comply with international accessibility standards.",
    "category": "Web Performance",
